# Measured off art/back.jpg (coverage, plate 1, nothing lettered on
# it), as fractions of its width (1060px): the shield between 0.48 and
# 0.82, centred on the width (asked at 0.60 of the height, came at
# 0.47); the band from 1.271 (0.908 of the height), 0.129 tall, near
# black violet as named — a short band, so the strip is one row, the
# install command beside the name. No frame on the plate, so the
# screenshots start near the top of the face, two frames at the shots'
# own proportion (900x780 and 784x680, both 1.153).
